  "title": "Arrow Family of Companies Donates $776,000 and Logs Nearly 12,000 Volunteer Hours",
  "summary": "GLENS FALLS, N.Y. (March 6, 2025) — The Arrow Family of Companies is proud to announce its 2024 giving, which resulted in total donations of $776,050, including $108,702 in employee contributions. Additionally, the Arrow team logged 11,902 volunteer hours, marking continued growth in community engagement. Since 2019, the Arrow Family of Companies has donated more than $3.4 million to local organizations, with contributions increasing by 45 percent over that period. Volunteerism has...",
